---
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Finanzas personales sin friccion</p>
      <h1>Mi Comodoro ordena tu dinero antes de que el mes te ordene a ti.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        Planea ingresos, controla gastos y visualiza tus metas de ahorro en una sola experiencia simple, rapida y pensada para decisiones diarias.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Acciones principales">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="#contacto">Quiero probarlo</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="#beneficios">Ver beneficios</a>
      </div>
      <dl class="hero-stats" aria-label="Indicadores destacados">
        <div>
          <dt>3 min</dt>
          <dd>para crear tu plan mensual</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>24/7</dt>
          <dd>claridad sobre tu presupuesto</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>100%</dt>
          <dd>enfocado en habitos reales</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Vista previa del producto">
      <div class="app-shell">
        <div class="app-topbar">
          <span></span>
          <span></span>
          <span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-content">
          <div class="balance-panel">
            <p>Balance disponible</p>
            <strong>$2.450.000</strong>
            <small>+18% frente al mes anterior</small>
          </div>
          <div class="chart" aria-hidden="true">
            <span style="height: 38%"></span>
            <span style="height: 52%"></span>
            <span style="height: 68%"></span>
            <span style="height: 44%"></span>
            <span style="height: 78%"></span>
            <span style="height: 61%"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="task-list">
            <div>
              <span></span>
              <p>Arriendo</p>
              <strong>Pagado</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span></span>
              <p>Meta vacaciones</p>
              <strong>72%</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span></span>
              <p>Gastos variables</p>
              <strong>En rango</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 72px 0 88px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 18%, rgb(242 111 79 / 13%), transparent 28%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #fbfdfb 0%, #f3f7f2 100%);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(360px, 0.9fr);
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-copy h1 {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 6vw, 5.3rem);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    max-width: 630px;
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.16rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .hero-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 44px 0 0;
  }

  .hero-stats div {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding-left: 14px;
  }

  .hero-stats dt {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .hero-stats dd {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .hero-visual {
    position: relative;
  }

  .app-shell {
    width: min(100%, 500px);
    margin-inline: auto;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 80%);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  .app-topbar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 16px;
    background: #f8faf8;
  }

  .app-topbar span {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #bcc8c0;
  }

  .app-content {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 22px;
  }

  .balance-panel {
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--color-brand-dark);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .balance-panel p,
  .balance-panel small {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 76%);
  }

  .balance-panel strong {
    display: block;
    margin: 8px 0;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .chart {
    display: grid;
    height: 160px;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    align-items: end;
    gap: 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--color-sky);
    padding: 18px;
  }

  .chart span {
    border-radius: 8px 8px 2px 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-accent), #ffd6bf);
  }

  .task-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .task-list div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 12px 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 12px;
  }

  .task-list span {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-brand);
  }

  .task-list p,
  .task-list strong {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero {
      padding-top: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .hero-stats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero-actions .button {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
